[D] [G] [D] [Bm] [A] [G] [D]

{comment: Verse 1}
L[D]et The King of My Heart Be[G] the Mountain Where I[D] Run. [Bm]The Fountain I [D]Drink From [G]Oh, is My So[D]ng.
Let The King of My Heart Be the Shadow Where I Hide. The Ransom For My Life Oh, He is My Song.

{comment: Chorus}
You Are Good[Bm], [A]Good [G]Oh.[D] 4X

{comment: Verse 2}
L[D]et the King of My Heart [G]Be the Wind Inside My [D]Sails. T[Bm]he Anchor in the [D]Waves O[G]h, He is My S[D]ong.
Let the King of My Heart Be the Fire Inside My Veins. The Echo of My Days Oh, He is My Song.

